@startuml Use Cases Overview
left to right direction

actor "Proxy Administrator" as admin
actor "Charger" as charger
actor "Primary Backend" as primary
actor "Secondary Backend" as secondary
actor "Secondary Backend Operator" as secondary_operator

rectangle "ocpp-2w-proxy" {
    usecase "UC-001\nConfigure and Run Proxy" as UC001
    usecase "UC-002\nConnect Charger" as UC002
    usecase "UC-003\nRelay Charger Messages" as UC003
    usecase "UC-004\nRelay Backend Commands" as UC004
    usecase "UC-006\nDeliver Billing Messages to Secondary Backends" as UC006
}

note bottom of secondary
  Any number of Secondary Backends
  may be configured per Charger.
end note

admin --> UC001
charger --> UC002
charger --> UC003
primary --> UC003
secondary --> UC003
primary --> UC004
secondary --> UC004
secondary --> UC006
secondary_operator --> UC006

note bottom of UC006
  Delivery is initiated automatically by the proxy.
  The operator is the beneficiary; the queue is internal.
  Primary billing delivery is part of UC-003.
end note

' UC-005 "Control Secondary Backend Commands" is obsolete, superseded by UC-004.

@enduml
